function BusinessIndex(){const b=["Café & Coffee Shop","Restaurant","Hotel","Bakery & Pastry","Bar & Lounge","Catering & Banqueting","Fast Food / QSR","School & Institution","Corporate / Office Catering","Event & Hospitality"];return <main className="mx-auto max-w-[1920px] px-4 py-8"><div className="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#008f68]">Shop by Business Type</div><h1 className="mt-2 break-words text-3xl font-semibold md:text-4xl">Solutions for your operation</h1><p className="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Browse live Shopify catalogue products selected for common hospitality and foodservice operations.</p><div className="mt-7 grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">{b.map(x=><Link key={x} href={`/business/${businessSlugFor(x)}`} className="min-w-0 rounded border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-[#008f68] hover:shadow-sm"><Building2 size={22} className="text-[#008f68]"/><h2 className="mt-4 break-words text-lg font-bold">{x}</h2><p className="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-500">Browse products commonly used by {x.toLowerCase()} operations.</p></Link>)}</div></main>}
function BusinessPage({name,onAdd,onQuick}:{name:string;onAdd:any;onQuick:any}){const [items,setItems]=useState<Product[]>([]);const [cursor,setCursor]=useState<string|null>(null);const [more,setMore]=useState(false);const terms=name.toLowerCase().split(" ").map(x=>x.replace(/[^a-z0-9]+/g,"")).filter(Boolean);const businessQuery=terms.map(t=>`title:*${t}* OR product_type:*${t}*`).join(" OR ");useEffect(()=>{let live=true;setItems([]);setCursor(null);setMore(false);getProducts(48,null,businessQuery,"BEST_SELLING",false).then(r=>{if(live){setItems(r.products.slice(0,24));setCursor(r.pageInfo.hasNextPage?r.pageInfo.endCursor:null)}}).catch(()=>{if(live){setItems([]);setCursor(null)}});return()=>{live=false}},[name,businessQuery]);const loadMore=async()=>{if(!cursor||more)return;setMore(true);try{const r=await getProducts(48,cursor,businessQuery,"BEST_SELLING",false);setItems(prev=>[...prev,...r.products]);setCursor(r.pageInfo.hasNextPage?r.pageInfo.endCursor:null)}finally{setMore(false)}};const list=items;return <main className="mx-auto max-w-[1920px] px-4 py-8"><div className="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#008f68]">Business Type</div><h1 className="mt-2 break-words text-3xl font-semibold md:text-4xl">{name}</h1><p className="mt-3 text-slate-600">Products selected from the live BuyHoreca catalogue for this type of operation.</p><div className="mt-7 grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 xl:grid-cols-5">{list.map(p=><ProductCard key={p.id} p={p} onAdd={onAdd} onQuick={onQuick}/>)}</div>{cursor&&<div className="mt-7 text-center"><button type="button" onClick={()=>void loadMore()} className="border border-slate-300 bg-white px-7 py-3 text-sm font-semibold hover:border-[#008f68]">{more?"Loading…":"Load more products"}</button></div>}</main>}
function CartPage({cart,onUpdate,onRemove,onDiscount}:{cart:Cart|null;onUpdate:any;onRemove:any;onDiscount:(code:string)=>Promise<boolean>}){const [code,setCode]=useState("");const [busy,setBusy]=useState(false);const [message,setMessage]=useState("");const applied=cart?.discountCodes||[];const apply=async(e:any)=>{e.preventDefault();setBusy(true);setMessage("");const ok=await onDiscount(code.trim());setMessage(ok?"Discount code updated.":"The code could not be applied to this cart.");setBusy(false)};const clear=async()=>{setBusy(true);setCode("");await onDiscount("");setMessage("Discount removed.");setBusy(false)};return <main className="mx-auto max-w-[1300px] px-4 py-10"><div className="flex flex-col gap-2 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between"><div><div className="text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#008f68]">Your order</div><h1 className="text-3xl font-semibold md:text-4xl">Shopping Cart</h1><p className="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500">Review quantities, apply a Shopify discount code and continue to secure checkout.</p></div><Link href="/quote" className="text-sm font-semibold text-[#008f68]">Need a bulk quote? Build a quote basket <ArrowRight size={14} className="inline"/></Link></div>{!cart?.lines.length?<div className="mt-7 border border-slate-200 bg-white p-10 text-center"><p className="text-lg font-bold">Your cart is empty.</p><Link href="/shop" className="mt-5 inline-block rounded bg-[#008f68] px-6 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white">Continue Shopping</Link></div>:<div className="mt-7 grid gap-7 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_360px]"><div className="border border-slate-200 bg-white">{cart.lines.map(l=><div key={l.id} className="flex gap-4 border-b border-slate-200 p-5"><div className="size-24 shrink-0 bg-slate-50 p-2"><img src={l.merchandise.image?.url||"/product-placeholder.svg"} alt={l.merchandise.image?.altText||l.merchandise.product.title} className="h-full w-full object-contain object-center" loading="lazy"/></div><div className="min-w-0 flex-1"><Link href={`/products/${l.merchandise.product.handle}`} className="font-semibold hover:text-[#008f68]">{l.merchandise.product.title}</Link><div className="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500">{l.merchandise.title}</div><div className="mt-2 font-bold">{money(l.merchandise.price)}</div><div className="mt-3 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><button type="button" onClick={()=>onUpdate(l.id,l.quantity-1)} className="grid size-8 place-items-center border" aria-label={`Decrease quantity for ${l.merchandise.product.title}`}><Minus size={13}/></button><span className="w-7 text-center text-sm font-bold">{l.quantity}</span><button type="button" onClick={()=>onUpdate(l.id,l.quantity+1)} disabled={typeof l.merchandise.quantityAvailable==="number"&&l.quantity>=l.merchandise.quantityAvailable} className="grid size-8 place-items-center border disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-40" aria-label={`Increase quantity for ${l.merchandise.product.title}`}><Plus size={13}/></button><button type="button" onClick={()=>onRemove(l.id)} className="ml-3 text-xs font-bold text-red-600" aria-label={`Remove ${l.merchandise.product.title} from cart`}>Remove</button></div>{cartLineStockMessage(l)&&<div className={`mt-2 text-[11px] font-semibold ${cartLineStockIssue(l)?"text-amber-700":"text-slate-500"}`}>{cartLineStockMessage(l)}</div>}</div></div>)}</div><div className="h-max border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6"><h2 className="text-xl font-bold">Order Summary</h2><form onSubmit={apply} className="mt-5"><label className="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600" htmlFor="discount-code">Discount code</label><div className="mt-2 flex gap-2"><input id="discount-code" value={code} onChange={e=>setCode(e.target.value)} placeholder="Enter code" className="min-w-0 flex-1 border border-slate-300 px-3 py-2.5 text-sm outline-none focus:border-[#008f68]"/><button disabled={busy||!code.trim()} type="submit" className="shrink-0 rounded border border-slate-300 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold disabled:opacity-50">{busy?"…":"Apply"}</button></div></form>{applied.length>0&&<div className="mt-3 grid gap-2">{applied.map(d=><div key={d.code} className={`flex items-center justify-between gap-2 rounded px-3 py-2 text-xs font-semibold ${d.applicable?"bg-[#e9f6f2] text-[#006f52]":"bg-slate-100 text-slate-600"}`}><span>{d.code} · {d.applicable?"Applied":"Not applicable"}</span>{d.applicable&&<button type="button" onClick={()=>void clear()} className="underline">Remove</button>}</div>)}</div>}{message&&<p className="mt-2 text-[11px] text-slate-500">{message}</p>}<div className="mt-6 flex justify-between text-sm"><span>Subtotal</span><b>{money(cart.cost.subtotalAmount)}</b></div><div className="mt-3 flex justify-between text-xl font-bold"><span>Total</span><span>{money(cart.cost.totalAmount)}</span></div><div className="mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2"><Link href="/" className="flex h-12 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded border border-slate-300 bg-white text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 transition hover:border-[#008f68] hover:text-[#008f68]"><HomeIcon size={15}/> Home</Link>{cartHasStockIssue(cart)?<button type="button" disabled className="flex h-12 items-center justify-center rounded bg-slate-300 px-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-600" title="Remove unavailable or over-limit items before checkout">Remove unavailable items before checkout</button>:<a href={cart.checkoutUrl} className="flex h-12 items-center justify-center rounded bg-[#008f68] text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-[#007b5a]">Proceed to Checkout</a>}</div>{cartHasStockIssue(cart)&&<p className="mt-2 text-[11px] font-semibold text-amber-700">Some cart items are unavailable or exceed the available stock. Remove or reduce them, then checkout.</p>}</div></div>}</main>}
function Wishlist({ids,products,onAdd,onQuick}:{ids:string[];products:Product[];onAdd:any;onQuick:any}){const [snapshots,setSnapshots]=useState<Product[]>([]);useEffect(()=>{setSnapshots(Object.values(readStoredSnapshots(WISHLIST_SNAPSHOT_KEY)))},[ids]);const map=new Map([...snapshots,...products].map(p=>[p.id,p]));const list=ids.map(id=>map.get(id)).filter(Boolean) as Product[];const clearAll=()=>{writeStoredJSON(WISHLIST_KEY,[]);writeStoredJSON(WISHLIST_SNAPSHOT_KEY,{});window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent("buyhoreca:wishlist",{detail:[]}));window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent("buyhoreca:toast",{detail:"Wishlist cleared"}))};return <main className="mx-auto max-w-[1920px] px-4 py-8"><div className="flex flex-col gap-4 border-b border-slate-200 pb-5 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between"><div><div className="text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#008f68]">Saved products</div><h1 className="mt-1 text-3xl font-semibold md:text-4xl">Wishlist <span className="text-lg font-bold text-slate-400">({ids.length})</span></h1><p className="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500">Keep products here for later purchasing or quote requests.</p></div><div className="flex items-center gap-3"><Link href="/shop" className="text-sm font-bold text-[#008f68]">Continue shopping <ArrowRight size={14} className="inline"/></Link>{ids.length>0&&<button type="button" onClick={clearAll} className="text-sm font-bold text-slate-500 hover:text-red-600">Clear wishlist</button>}</div></div>{!list.length?<div className="mt-8 rounded border border-dashed border-slate-300 bg-slate-50 p-12 text-center"><Heart className="mx-auto text-slate-400"/><h2 className="mt-3 text-xl font-bold">Your wishlist is empty</h2><p className="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">Save products with the heart button and they will stay here on this browser.</p><Link href="/shop" className="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded bg-[#008f68] px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white">Browse products <ArrowRight size={14}/></Link></div>:<div className="bh-catalog-grid mt-6">{list.map(p=><ProductCard key={p.id} p={p} onAdd={onAdd} onQuick={onQuick}/>)}</div>}</main>}
function ComparePage({ids,products,onAdd,onQuick}:{ids:string[];products:Product[];onAdd:any;onQuick:any}){const compareRows:Array<[string,(p:Product)=>string]>=[["Brand",p=>p.brand],["Product Type",p=>p.productType||"—"],["SKU",p=>firstPurchasableVariant(p)?.sku||p.variants[0]?.sku||"—"],["Availability",p=>{const v=firstPurchasableVariant(p);return isVariantPurchasable(v)?(lowStockLabel(v)||"Available"):"Out of stock · Request a quote"}],["Price",p=>money(firstPurchasableVariant(p)?.price||p.price)]];const [snapshots,setSnapshots]=useState<Product[]>([]);useEffect(()=>{try{const data=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem("buyhoreca_compare_snapshots")||"{}");if(data&&typeof data==="object")setSnapshots(Object.values(data))}catch{}},[ids]);const map=new Map([...snapshots,...products].map(p=>[p.id,p]));const list=ids.map(id=>map.get(id)).filter(Boolean) as Product[];const remove=(id:string)=>{try{const next=ids.filter(x=>x!==id);const data=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem("buyhoreca_compare_snapshots")||"{}");if(data&&typeof data==="object")delete data[id];localStorage.setItem("buyhoreca_compare_snapshots",JSON.stringify(data));localStorage.setItem("buyhoreca_compare",JSON.stringify(next));window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent("buyhoreca:compare",{detail:next}))}catch{}};return <main className="mx-auto max-w-[1920px] px-4 py-8"><div className="flex flex-col gap-2 border-b border-slate-200 pb-5 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between"><div><div className="text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#008f68]">Compare</div><h1 className="mt-1 text-3xl font-semibold md:text-4xl">Compare products</h1><p className="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">Compare up to four products from the live BuyHoreca catalogue.</p></div><Link href="/shop" className="text-sm font-bold text-[#008f68]">Continue shopping <ArrowRight size={14} className="inline"/></Link></div>{!list.length?<div className="mt-8 rounded border border-dashed border-slate-300 bg-slate-50 p-12 text-center"><Boxes className="mx-auto text-slate-400"/><h2 className="mt-3 text-xl font-bold">Nothing to compare yet</h2><p className="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">Use the compare icon on product cards to add products here.</p></div>:<><div className="mt-6 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">{list.map(p=><div key={p.id} className="rounded border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4"><div className="flex justify-end"><button type="button" onClick={()=>remove(p.id)} className="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 hover:text-red-600">Remove</button></div><div className="mt-2 aspect-square bg-slate-50 p-4"><img src={p.images[0]?.url||"/product-placeholder.svg"} alt={p.name} className="h-full w-full object-contain object-center" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div className="mt-4 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">{p.brand}</div><Link href={p.href} className="mt-1 block text-sm font-bold hover:text-[#008f68]">{p.name}</Link><div className="mt-2"> <Stars value={p.rating} count={p.reviewCount}/></div><div className="mt-2 text-lg font-bold">{money(firstPurchasableVariant(p)?.price||p.price)}</div>{lowStockLabel(firstPurchasableVariant(p))&&<div className="mt-1 text-[10px] font-semibold text-amber-700">{lowStockLabel(firstPurchasableVariant(p))}</div>}<div className="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500">SKU: {firstPurchasableVariant(p)?.sku||"—"}</div>{isVariantPurchasable(firstPurchasableVariant(p))?<button type="button" onClick={()=>onAdd(p,firstPurchasableVariant(p))} className="mt-4 flex h-10 w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded bg-[#008f68] text-xs font-semibold text-white"><ShoppingCart size={14}/> Add to Cart</button>:<button type="button" onClick={()=>{addToQuote(p,firstPurchasableVariant(p));location.href="/quote"}} className="mt-4 flex h-10 w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded border border-slate-300 bg-white text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700"><FileText size={14}/> Request a Quote</button>}</div>)}</div><div className="mt-6 overflow-x-auto rounded border border-slate-200 bg-white"><table className="min-w-[760px] w-full text-sm"><tbody><tr className="border-b border-slate-200"><th className="w-48 bg-slate-50 p-4 text-left text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">Attribute</th>{list.map(p=><td key={p.id} className="p-4 font-bold">{p.name}</td>)}</tr>{compareRows.map(([label,get])=><tr key={String(label)} className="border-b border-slate-100 last:border-0"><th className="bg-slate-50 p-4 text-left text-xs font-bold text-slate-500">{label}</th>{list.map(p=><td key={p.id} className="p-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700">{get(p)}</td>)}</tr>)}</tbody></table></div></>}</main>}

function QuickView({p,close,onAdd}:{p:Product;close:()=>void;onAdd:any}){useBodyScrollLock(true);const v=firstPurchasableVariant(p);const canBuy=p.availableForSale&&isVariantPurchasable(v);return <div className="fixed inset-0 z-[110] grid place-items-center bg-black/40 p-4" onMouseDown={close}><div onMouseDown={e=>e.stopPropagation()} role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label={`Quick view: ${p.name}`} className="max-h-[92vh] w-full max-w-4xl overflow-auto bg-white p-6 shadow-2xl" data-lenis-prevent data-native-scroll onWheelCapture={handleNativeWheel}><div className="flex justify-end"><button type="button" onClick={close} className="grid size-10 place-items-center border" aria-label="Close quick view" title="Close" autoFocus><X/></button></div><div className="grid gap-7 md:grid-cols-2"><div className="aspect-square bg-slate-50 p-6"><img src={p.images[0]?.url||"/product-placeholder.svg"} alt={p.name} className="h-full w-full object-contain object-center"/></div><div><div className="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#008f68]">{p.brand}</div><h2 className="mt-2 text-3xl font-bold">{p.name}</h2><Stars value={p.rating} count={p.reviewCount}/><div className="mt-5 text-2xl font-bold">{money(v?.price||p.price)}</div>{lowStockLabel(v)&&<div className="mt-2 text-xs font-semibold text-amber-700">{lowStockLabel(v)}</div>}{!canBuy&&<div className="mt-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600">Out of stock · Request a quote</div>}<p className="mt-4 line-clamp-6 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">{p.description}</p><div className="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2">{canBuy?<button type="button" onClick={()=>onAdd(p,v)} className="h-12 rounded bg-[#008f68] px-7 text-sm font-semibold text-white">Add to Cart</button>:<button type="button" onClick={()=>{addToQuote(p,v);close();location.href="/quote"}} className="h-12 rounded border border-slate-300 px-5 text-sm font-semibold hover:border-[#008f68] hover:text-[#008f68]">Request a Quote</button>}<button type="button" onClick={()=>addToQuote(p,v)} className="h-12 rounded border border-slate-300 px-5 text-sm font-semibold hover:border-[#008f68] hover:text-[#008f68]">Add to Quote</button><Link href={p.href} onClick={close} className="inline-flex h-12 items-center border border-slate-300 px-5 text-sm font-semibold">Full Product</Link></div></div></div></div></div>}
export default App;
